[ceiling] Specified supported pump-capture faces: the broad fixed block starts at the flange-bearing datum Z215.074, and the two fitted boss shoulders end at Z236.074. These planes have the supported-face allowance and close the pump capture when the underside snap retainer is seated. The block continues upward into the housing. The native print reading identifies support access through the unloaded pump opening and motor bores before hardware installation; physical cleanup and bearing finish remain unqualified.
alternatives: Filling the pump openings occupies the motor-first loading envelope. Sloping the entire underside removes the stated bearing datums. Retaining only the contact lands and adding separate ramps around them changes the approved plain broad block into additional outer boundaries.
