[sliver] Functional hook-bearing floors of the approved pump snap. The 1.10 mm X land at Z165.045 runs from |X|98.5 to 99.6 and matches the seated hooks; the only interruption along Y is the requested central screwdriver port. These are the intended retention faces, not strips left by mismatched cuts. Their two 32.0075 mm runs supply 70.4165 mm² of nominal floor area per side. Native geometry and the current print receipt are in enclosure/pump-snap-review; this area is not a load-capacity result.
alternatives: Enlarging this land requires a deeper hook engagement and greater inward hook travel. Removing it removes vertical capture. The approved common wing/hook Y ends and central release opening determine the two uninterrupted bearing runs.
